%% Source: backend/services/claim-intake/README.md "Status rules" (ASCII). Drawn as a UML state machine.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> SUBMITTED : POST /api/claims
    SUBMITTED --> DOCS_PENDING : member validated
    DOCS_PENDING --> DOCS_VERIFIED : all required documents VERIFIED
    DOCS_VERIFIED --> ELIGIBILITY_CHECKED : Check ok
    DOCS_VERIFIED --> ASSESSED : [eligibility failed]
    DOCS_VERIFIED --> UNDER_REVIEW : [both checks failed]
    ELIGIBILITY_CHECKED --> ASSESSED : Assess ok
    ELIGIBILITY_CHECKED --> UNDER_REVIEW : [assessment failed]
    ASSESSED --> UNDER_REVIEW
    ELIGIBILITY_CHECKED --> APPROVED : UpdateStatus
    ASSESSED --> APPROVED : UpdateStatus
    UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED : UpdateStatus
    ELIGIBILITY_CHECKED --> REJECTED : UpdateStatus
    ASSESSED --> REJECTED : UpdateStatus
    UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : UpdateStatus
    APPROVED --> SETTLING : CanCommit / vote YES
    SETTLEMENT_FAILED --> SETTLING : retry, CanCommit / vote YES
    APPROVED --> SETTLEMENT_FAILED : Abort
    SETTLING --> SETTLED : DoCommit
    SETTLING --> SETTLEMENT_FAILED : Abort
    REJECTED --> [*]
    SETTLED --> [*]
